#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:3
#: de8ad42094ab4137a85cf15a4ee79acb
msgid "How to upgrade to Qubes 4.2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:6
#: ed8af3b5c37d4d16b34dc336d0ec38bd
msgid ""
"This page explains how to upgrade from Qubes 4.1 to Qubes 4.2. There are two "
"ways to upgrade: a clean installation or an in-place upgrade. In general, a "
"clean installation is simpler and less error-prone, but an in-place upgrade "
"allows you to preserve your customizations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:9
#: 67c12b6c4ca5493586798e33b43b7ee5
msgid "Back up"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:12
#: 64471c05bef84ce0a78baf43c879afee
msgid ""
"Before attempting either an in-place upgrade or a clean installation, we "
"strongly recommend that you first :doc:`back up your system </user/how-to-"
"guides/how-to-back-up-restore-and-migrate>` so that you don’t lose any data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:15
#: 6f0388a16f21421b9bf31abc6ba46bb4
msgid "Clean installation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:18
#: 4aa483c682954390b95cef6bd0075fee
msgid ""
"If you would prefer to perform a clean installation rather than upgrading in-"
"place:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:20
#: 9f60264d3cf742cf9c51c6ca448264b8
msgid ""
"(optional) Run the updater to ensure all of your templates are in their "
"latest version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:22
#: da95a2d69d34450caafd9dc5ba8f0433
msgid ""
"Install the ``qubes-dist-upgrade`` tool. This is the inplace upgrade tool, "
"which is not what we’re doing. However it will be needed in order to prepare "
"the templates for the 4.2 version. You install it with the following command "
"in the dom0 terminal:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:30
#: a76127dfe62142f09d6bae1d3155070e
msgid ""
"Change your templates to use the 4.2 repositories instead of the 4.1 ones. "
"You do this with the following command in the dom0 terminal:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:37
#: d51e8ddb06c44b80a459517ed1dab3a3
msgid ""
"**Note**: This step is critical to ensure the templates will receive updates "
"once Qubes 4.1 reaches end-of-life (EOL) and was missing in previous clean "
"installation instructions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:39
#: d43a6e5733574e669f78d7661edf16d6
msgid ""
"Create a :ref:`backup <user/how-to-guides/how-to-back-up-restore-and-migrate:"
"creating a backup>` of your current installation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:41
#: 472f174ea23d40bebf9829d17c38a531
msgid ""
"`Download <https://www.qubes-os.org/downloads/>`__ the latest 4.2 release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:43
#: aa6eb04cabb444d88d102144212d3694
msgid ""
"Follow the :doc:`installation guide </user/downloading-installing-upgrading/"
"installation-guide>` to install Qubes 4.2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:45
#: 03862abe1b85448f8c2611b3f5c22160
msgid ""
":ref:`Restore from your backup <user/how-to-guides/how-to-back-up-restore-"
"and-migrate:restoring from a backup>` on your new 4.2 installation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:50
#: 4868d5e54f224e66b5a422452229d4fa
msgid "In-place upgrade"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:53
#: c7776e20c04846839f9fb6dfc4de6088
msgid ""
"**Warning:** It is not possible to upgrade directly from releases earlier "
"than 4.1. If you’re still on an earlier release, please either perform a :"
"ref:`clean installation of 4.2 <user/downloading-installing-upgrading/"
"upgrade/4_2:clean installation>` or :doc:`upgrade to 4.1 </user/downloading-"
"installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_1>` first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:55
#: 6dc3640377614b189bb94f8ee7457124
msgid ""
"The upgrade may take several hours, and will download several gigabytes of "
"data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:57
#: 2aa6c8cf64284134a901f4d6051c32bf
msgid ""
"In place upgrade is a complex operation. For this reason, we provide a "
"``qubes-dist-upgrade`` tool to handle all the necessary steps automatically. "
"You can install it with the following command in the dom0 terminal:"
msgstr ""

